// GsAdamantiteSword.Desc: Reforged: slow, crushing adamantite cleaves; the finisher drops as an overhead slam that breaks armor and quakes the ground
// GsBeamSword.Desc: Reforged: every slash casts a beam wave; beam hits charge the blade, and at three charges the next beam erupts into a vast annihilating lance, wider, brighter, piercing deeper
// GsBladetongue.Desc: Reforged: a living crimson blade; striking foes spits twin arcing streams of ichor that lower defense, and the finishing beat's kiss leaves a lingering ichor geyser erupting on the spot
// GsBluePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsBluePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsBreakerBlade.Desc: Reforged: a two-beat wrecking rhythm; deals 2.5x damage to foes above 90% life, and landing that opening blow shatters their guard in an armor-breaking shockwave
// GsChlorophyteClaymore.Desc: Reforged: a two-beat greatblade; every swing hurls a verdant core that pulses thorns in flight, and the overhead finisher's core roots the ground where it strikes, slowing and stabbing whatever lingers
// GsChlorophyteSaber.Desc: Reforged: a swift three-beat saber; every slash seeds a lingering spore shroud along the arc's edge, and blade strikes on shrouded targets deal bonus damage and stack venom
// GsChristmasTreeSword.Desc: Reforged: each slash hurls a festive ornament in turn: a bursting bauble, a piercing gold star, then a gift box that cracks into shards and raises a little tree of blinking lights that sprinkles stinging stardust
// GsCobaltSword.Desc: Reforged: keep the combo unbroken and the cobalt edge swings ever faster; the fourth strike trails a blue echo arc that cuts again
// GsCutlass.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat plunder dance with rising tempo; land hits to build Panache, and with enough swagger the fourth beat becomes a whirling double-arc slash that strikes twice all around
// GsDD2SquireBetsySword.Desc: Reforged: every slash looses a sonic dragon-roar wave; hits feed the Dragon Soul, and at 4 souls the finisher's wave ascends into twin coiling dragons
// GsDD2SquireDemonSword.Desc: Reforged: raise the shield with right click as ever; a perfect block still repays fivefold force on the next strike, and brands the blade with hellfire: the next three slashes hurl burning waves that ignite foes
// GsExcalibur.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat rite of daylight; every slash casts a holy arc, hits build Radiance, and the fourth judgment strike detonates it as a sacred nova
// GsFetidBaghnakhs.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat point-blank claw flurry; every hit rakes a festering mark into the target, and the fourth mark bursts into pus, poisoning and envenoming everything it splatters
// GsFrostbrand.Desc: Reforged: winter's breath; every slash exhales a frost bolt that stalls and surges in flight, hits inflict Frostburn, and the finishing beat fans the bolt into three ice shards
// GsGreenPhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsGreenPhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsHamBat.Desc: Reforged: the power of satiety; swings grow greasier and mightier with your Well Fed tier (+5%/+10%/+15% damage), and the finishing beat splatters meat scraps with a burst of savory aroma
// GsInfluxWaver.Desc: Reforged: Martian phase-steel; every slash casts a phase wave that blinks to the far side of its victim and strikes back twice, blink strikes brand the target with a phase mark, and the third overdrive slash calls an extra phase blade on every branded foe, up to three
// GsKeybrand.Desc: Reforged: strikes deal up to double damage as the target's health falls; below 30% health the blade lights golden key-runes, and executing such prey bursts into unlocking light
// GsMeowmere.Desc: Reforged: a candy-frosted cat blade playing a four-beat meow sonata; every slash flings a bouncing cat head trailing rainbow ribbon, hits collect musical notes, and at seven notes the finisher calls a cat meteor crashing down from the sky
// GsMythrilSword.Desc: Reforged: every slash brands its target with a mythril seal; the third seal rings out as a resonant shockwave
// GsOrangePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsOrangePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsOrichalcumSword.Desc: Reforged: each swing scatters drifting petals along the arc that flutter, then dive at nearby prey; the finisher looses a full bloom
// GsPalladiumSword.Desc: Reforged: hits store vitality in the warm palladium edge; the finisher draws it out as life motes that fly back and mend you, up to six per combo
// GsPearlwoodSword.Desc: Reforged: a playful pearlwood combo that flings bursting pearls with every slash; the third strike calls a short pearl rain from above
// GsPiercingStarlight.Desc: Reforged: each use is a three-thrust starlight cadence; the final thrust fires a piercing star bolt, and three faultless cadences in a row make the bolt burst into a starburst on hit
// GsPsychoKnife.Desc: Reforged: a two-beat flicker of blackened steel; the first strike from deep stealth is a backstab dealing heavily bonus damage, and kills fade you back to half-stealth instead of fully exposing you
// GsPurplePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsPurplePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsRedPhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsRedPhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsSeedler.Desc: Reforged: every slash hurls a spinning seed pod that bounces and bursts into a fan of seeking thorns; the finisher's pod erupts into vines, raising a lingering bramble patch that keeps stabbing
// GsSlapHand.Desc: Reforged: a three-beat divine slapping; every hit stamps a giant palm print with absurd knockback along the swing, and the finisher claps both palms together, ringing out a small shockwave
// GsStarWrath.Desc: Reforged: every slash calls three comet-tailed stars down from the night sky; landed hits build the Star Tide, and at full tide the finishing slash unleashes a cascade of falling stars crowned by one great star that bursts into a ring
// GsTerraBlade.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat duet where the light soul and the night soul take turns; every slash casts a terra wave in that soul's color, and the fourth beat fuses both souls into a grand resonant blade that detonates a verdant star ring on hit
// GsTheHorsemansBlade.Desc: Reforged: striking a foe summons a flaming jack-o'-lantern to run it down; repeated strikes on one victim brand Headhunt marks, and at full marks the finishing slash calls a cavalry of four burning pumpkins to trample the line
// GsTitaniumSword.Desc: Reforged: every slash leaves a titanium shade hanging in the air that replays the same cut half a beat later
// GsTrueExcalibur.Desc: Reforged: a three-beat rite of daybreak; every slash hurls a piercing wave of daylight that grows mightier with each beat, and the third wave detonates a cross of holy light where it strikes
// GsTrueNightsEdge.Desc: Reforged: the night tide; each heavy slash hurls a great wave of night that slows, stalls, then rushes back for a second cut, and the final wave swells larger, shedding two lesser night blades as it turns
// GsWhitePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsWhitePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsYellowPhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
// GsYellowPhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
// GsZenith.Desc: Reforged: the pivot of ten thousand blades; every slash hurls phantom swords of history that arc to your cursor and return, hits build Sword Will, and the third strike unleashes a converging blade formation that tears open a spacetime rift at full Will
